{07 14 00}What's up, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}?{01 00 00 14 00}
Feel like catching bugs
sometime, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?
{07 00 00}I'll point them out and you 
can do the legwork. I'm
not really into exercise.
{07 03 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Great, it's a deal!{01 00 00 14 00}
{07 15 00}Come on, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 0f 00}
Get a move on, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!

messages.et:
{07 14 00}Mis toimub, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}?{01 00 00 14 00}
Tahaks kunagi putukaid
püüda, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?
{07 00 00}Mina osutan neile ja sina 
teed jooksutöö. Mind ei
huvita eriti liikumine.
{07 03 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Suurepärane, kokkulepe!{01 00 00 14 00}
{07 15 00}Tule nüüd, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 0f 00}
Liiguta ennast, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!

Hei, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 0f 00}
{07 0b 00}Kas oled kunagi katsunud
{04 1a 00}?{02 00 00 14 14}
Muidugi!
Ei iial.

messages.en:
{07 15 00}SHHHHH!{01 01 00}{07 02 00}{01 08 00} Did you hear that?!{01 00 00 05 00}
BUGS!!!{01 00 00 0a 00} They're everywhere!
We're surrounded!{01 00 00 05 00}
{07 06 00}They want to take
revenge on me for catching
their friends, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!

messages.et:
{07 15 00}ŠŠŠŠ!{01 01 00}{07 02 00}{01 08 00} Kas sa kuulsid seda?!{01 00 00 05 00}
PUTUKAD!!!{01 00 00 0a 00} Nad on kõikjal!
Me oleme ümber piiratud!{01 00 00 05 00}
{07 06 00}Nad tahavad mulle kätte
maksta nende sõprade
püüdmise eest, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!

